This task is to do initial configuration for SC7 feature which is a standy mode feature.

Installing a standby_setup script into the root crontab to execute at reboot. This standby_setup initializes with mkdir in /dev/shm, touch necessary files in /dev/shm

These are essential to start functioning of SC7 feature which comes with new service nd_suspendresume.service

Since this is installed to crontab @reboot, for the first time during update, this standby_setup script is needed to be executed in runasroot during the update so that when new service is started it can find the initializations.
